&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://linuxbcn.org/world-pinhole-day-2020-holga120wpc/"&gt;https://linuxbcn.org/world-pinhole-day-2020-holga120wpc/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aquest més experimental i molt locu:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://linuxbcn.org/world-pinhole-day-2020-anamorphic-camera/"&gt;https://linuxbcn.org/world-pinhole-day-2020-anamorphic-camera/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
